cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the archived software release."
title: "Affine Geometry of Gaussian ReLU Networks via Conditional Kac-Rice Formulas: code and data"
abstract: >-
  Code and saved outputs reproducing every table and figure of the article
  "Affine Geometry of Gaussian ReLU Networks via Conditional Kac-Rice Formulas".
  Includes the one-dimensional Monte Carlo verification, the Crofton estimator
  for the higher-dimensional boundary measure, and the exploratory and
  replicated Breast Cancer Wisconsin studies. All computations are deterministic
  and the random seeds are recorded.
